            "Solve for $x$: $7x = 21 \\implies x = 3$.",
            "Substitute $x = 3$ into (1): $2(3) + y = 7 \\implies 6 + y = 7 \\implies y = 1$."
          ],
          "finalAnswer": "$$x = 3, \\quad y = 1$$"
        },
