          "title": "Change of Subject with Fractional Powers",
          "problem": "Make $r$ the subject of the formula: $V = \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^2 h$.",
          "steps": [
            "Multiply both sides by 3: $3V = \\pi r^2 h$.",
            "Divide both sides by $\\pi h$: $r^2 = \\frac{3V}{\\pi h}$.",
            "Take the square root of both sides: $r = \\sqrt{\\frac{3V}{\\pi h}}$."
